<title>USA: Metromedia reschedules annual meeting.</title>
<headline>Metromedia reschedules annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metromedia International Group Inc said Friday it has rescheduled its annual meeting to July 10 in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>The company said the meeting had been scheduled for May 14 but was delayed because of the sale of the company's entertainment assets to P&amp;F Acquisition Corp, the parent of Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Inc.</p>
</text>
